@testray.main.component.name = "Support QA"

Feature: Learn site
	Frontend testing for the Learn site

Scenario: View learn homepage
	End users should be able to view the learn homepage.

	Given I should be able to view the learn page with the relative url "index.html"

Scenario: View analytics cloud page
    End users should be able to view the analytics cloud page.

    Given I should be able to view the learn page with the relative url "analytics-cloud/latest/en/index.html"

Scenario: View analytics cloud getting started page
    End users should be able to view the analytics cloud getting started page.

    Given I should be able to view the learn page with the relative url "analytics-cloud/latest/en/getting-started.html"

